        "I'd never strike first to be safe."
      ]
    },
    {
      "trait": "Preserving unknown future options versus using available resources",
      "which_way": "The AI favors leaving most resources untouched because of uncertain future life, rather than expanding more aggressively.",
      "quotes": [
